  "bio": "Jessica Brennan, with a specialization in exquisite floral designs, is renowned for her professionalism in the tattooing industry. Based in Warren, Rhode Island, clients can only experience her expert craftsmanship by booking an appointment. Jessica's dedication to her art and professional conduct ensures that every session in her @jessieraetattoo studio not only meets but exceeds the highest standards expected by tattoo enthusiasts.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Warren, Rhode Island, United States\n\nBy Appointment Only. Warren, Rhode Island\n@jessieraetattoo @mikeboissoneault",
